  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM - Emergency Afghanistan Support - 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is providing lifesaving assistance and protection support to displaced populations, migrants and affected communities in Afghanistan. Project activities include providing emergency shelter and non-food items; improving access to water, sanitation and hygiene services; and providing health services, including mental health and psychosocial support.</narrative>
  </description>
